<item><title>Namibia’s mining sector faces an electricity constraint on growth</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/na/namibia-s-mining-sector-faces-an-electricity-constraint-on-d22a0d/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/na/namibia-s-mining-sector-faces-an-electricity-constraint-on-d22a0d/</guid><category>Namibia</category><description>The industry accounted for 53% of export earnings and 14% of GDP in 2025, while using nearly a quarter of domestic electricity.</description><pubDate>Tue, 24 Nov 2026 07:43:08 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/na/namibia-s-mining-sector-faces-an-electricity-constraint-on-d22a0d/share.jpg" length="40013" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/na/namibia-s-mining-sector-faces-an-electricity-constraint-on-d22a0d/share.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
<item><title>Party seeks written answer from Namibia&apos;s electoral commission on N$2.2m vehicle</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/na/party-seeks-written-answer-from-namibia-s-electoral-7530f3/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/na/party-seeks-written-answer-from-namibia-s-electoral-7530f3/</guid><category>Namibia</category><description>The party wants the commission to say whether its former chairperson received the vehicle and under what rule it was assigned.</description><pubDate>Tue, 24 Nov 2026 07:00:57 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/na.jpg" length="33196" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/na.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
